us /_next/data/seravlcJxTvMRAA75kTaQ/benchmarks/<slug>.json for all 406 benchmark slugs and /_next/data/seravlcJxTvMRAA75kTaQ/models/<slug>.json for all 409 model slugs (slug lists taken from sitemap-0..16.xml). All fetches issued from the page context; no DOM scraping needed except to verify column semantics.","site_stats":{"modelCount":415,"rankedModelCount":230,"verifiedRankedModelCount":105,"estimatedRankedModelCount":125,"benchmarkCount":413,"lastUpdated":"September 2, 2026"},"counts":{"benchmark_pages":406,"model_pages":409,"benchmark_leaderboard_rows":8861,"overall_leaderboard_rows_scored":230,"overall_leaderboard_rows_total":409,"category_index_rows":617,"elo_rows":172},"fetch_errors":[],"notes":["No XHR/fetch data API exists beyond /api/market (257 bytes, unrelated market blurb). All leaderboard data ships in Next.js SSG payloads, saved verbatim in raw.json.","raw.json holds the untouched pageProps for every benchmark page, every model page and the index/models/pricing/speed pages. Only exception: on the 409 model-detail payloads the keys comparisonLinks, faqs, visuals, seo, radar and peerPosition were dropped before saving because they made the file ~50 MB; every other field is verbatim.","The homepage leaderboard ships as tuple-encoded arrays (no column names in the payload). Column meaning was verified against the rendered DOM table for rows 1-4 (headers Model/Provider/License/Status/Reasoning/Context/Price in-out/Tok-s/Latency/Score/AG/CO/RE/MM/KN/ML/IF/MA/Elo). Verified mapping: [1]=model, [2]=slug, [3]=provider, [8]=contextWindow, [9]=contextTokens, [10]=inputPrice, [11]=outputPrice, [12]=blendedPrice, [13]=tokensPerSecond, [14]=latency/ttft seconds, [15]=Elo, [17]=release date, [26]=displayScore, [27]=full-precision overall score, [30]=category scores in order AG,CO,RE,MM,KN,ML,IF,MA.","rank for per-benchmark records is the position in the leaderboard order the site publishes for that benchmark (the site does not emit a numeric rank field there). 289 of 292 multi-row benchmarks are descending by score; 3 are ascending because lower is better (conceptual-reasoning, marketbench, omnisciencehallucinationrate) - in all cases position 1 is the model the site lists first.","rank for the Overall composite was computed by sorting the 230 scored models by full-precision overall score descending. Validated: it reproduces the site-published rank for all 154 models whose model page carries rankings.overall.rank, with zero mismatches.","cost_usd is the site blendedPrice in USD per 1M tokens (3:1 input:output blend as published by benchlm). input_price_usd_per_mtok, output_price_usd_per_mtok, tokens_per_second and latency_ttft_s are extra fields added to the Overall records only, since the requested schema had nowhere to put the speed/latency data the site publishes.","date is the model release date (ISO) from the homepage row, falling back to the model page releaseLabel. Missing where the site publishes none (1582 of 9880 records).","context_window prefers the model page documented value, falling back to the homepage column. Some rows show a value on the model page while the homepage column shows an em dash (e.g. Claude Opus 5); this is a site inconsistency, not an injected value.","Benchmark name collisions exist (376 distinct display names across 406 benchmark slugs); source_url disambiguates.","No values were estimated or invented. Missing data is omitted. Zero fetch errors; all 406 benchmark and 409 model endpoints returned HTTP 200.","Not captured (out of scope, no per-model benchmark scores): the 83,445 /compare/* pairwise pages, 93 provider pages, 81 blog posts, /voice-benchmarks, /leaderboards/korean-*."]}